    <!-- ===== About ===== -->
    <string name="about_tagline">Pro-grade tethering — phone → PC, at PdaNet level and beyond</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_what_title">About this project</string>
    <string name="about_what_body">NetBridge Pro is a complete, professional-grade suite for sharing your phone\'s internet with a PC — engineered for speed, security and total control. It pairs a multiprotocol SOCKS5/HTTP data plane with full radio-network control (2G–5G locks), a live signal monitor and a private USB-debugging security model.</string>
    <string name="about_what_body2">The data plane runs over USB tethering (NCM/RNDIS), ADB tunnel, Wi-Fi hotspot or Bluetooth PAN with automatic fallback. The control plane is an HMAC-SHA256-authenticated JSON bridge. DNS-over-HTTPS, per-app Windows firewall and a real in-tunnel speed test are built in.</string>
